- Bit (1) interacts with Transmission (2), Electrical System (4), and Housing (6). It also has contact with the External Environment (7) during operation.
- Transmission (2) interacts with Bit (1), Motor (3), Electrical System (4), and Housing (6).
- Motor (3) interacts only with Transmission (2) and Electrical System (4).
- Electrical System (4) interacts with Bit (1), Transmission (2), Motor (3), Battery Holder (5), Housing (6), and External Environment (7).
- Battery Holder (5) only interacts with the Electrical System (4).
- Housing (6) interacts with Bit (1), Transmission (2), Electrical System (4), and External Environment (7).
- External Environment (7) has contact with Bit (1), Electrical System (4), and Housing (6).
